  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/images/48a4696c4e637a5d782c49df7fc51fc817a02f90.jpeg\" alt=\"萬聖節橫幅\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">萬聖節大雜燴</h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fhalloween-mash-up\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/halloween-mash-up\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub贊助者\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrandonitaly\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"56\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">萬聖節快樂！穿上應景的恐怖裝扮，準備好迎接終極的Minecraft萬聖節驚險之旅吧！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此組合包包含方塊、物品、生物、使用者介面的恐怖材質，以及全新的音樂！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/images/c77959cfdd3a64bbf94807b633c1e20d9bd4028e.jpeg\" alt=\"世界預覽\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mXZavX3c/images/b6c62b6d26a6b675ddc9b7849e3c03970349615c.png\" alt=\"Legacy 4J Mod支援\"></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">此資源包是從遺留主機版移植的萬聖節大雜燴，並更新了基岩版的材質。原始材質由4J工作室製作。</p>",
